#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:172
msgid ""
"La copia se cortó y tu juego original quedó guardado aparte, completo. "
"¿Querés restaurarlo?"
msgstr ""
"The copy was interrupted and your original game was kept safe, complete. Do "
"you want to restore it?"

#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:175
msgid ""
"Versión anterior de la app, apartada antes de instalar la nueva. Está "
"completa: se puede devolver a su lugar."
msgstr ""
"The previous version of the app, set aside before installing the new one. It "
"is complete: it can be put back in place."

#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:178
msgid ""
"Carpeta donde se estaba armando la app nueva. Nunca llegó a instalarse, así "
"que solo se puede eliminar."
msgstr ""
"The folder where the new app was being assembled. It never finished "
"installing, so it can only be deleted."

#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:181
#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:184
msgid ""
"Archivo a medio escribir de una copia que se cortó. No es una versión "
"anterior de nada: solo se puede eliminar."
msgstr ""
"A half-written file from a copy that was cut short. It is not a previous "
"version of anything: it can only be deleted."

#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:187
msgid ""
"La copia se cortó y tu juego original quedó en la papelera de la unidad (que "
"en un pendrive no libera espacio). ¿Querés restaurarlo?"
msgstr ""
"The copy was interrupted and your original game ended up in the drive's "
"trash (which on a USB stick does not free any space). Do you want to restore "
"it?"

#: wiibackup_manager/recovery_service.py:298
